<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>BLUE TURTLE SQUAD | BTS - Kolaborasi Lindungi Penyu Anambas</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Blue Turtle Squad (BTS) - Platform Digital Kolaborasi Nyata untuk Lindungi Penyu di Kepulauan Anambas"
    />

    <!-- Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Outfit:wght@600;700;800;900&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />

    <!-- Leaflet Map CSS & JS -->
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css"
      integrity="sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY="
      crossorigin=""
    />

    <script
      const
      API_URL="https://blue-turtle-squad.marissacitra5.workers.dev"
      ;
      src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"
      integrity="sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo="
      crossorigin=""
    ></script>

    <!-- Lucide Icons -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>

    <!-- Chart.js -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-dark: #121524;
        --bg-sidebar: #15192c;
        --card-bg: #1c223c;
        --card-inner: #242c4c;
        --card-sub: #2b3458;

        --gold: #ffce31;
        --gold-soft: #ffd95c;
        --gold-glow: rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.25);

        --cyan: #29b6f6;
        --teal: #4ecca3;
        --danger: #ff5252;

        --text-main: #ffffff;
        --text-muted: #a4b3cf;
        --text-gold: #ffce31;

        --input-bg: #6e879f;
        --input-placeholder: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
        --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        --border-gold: rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.4);

        --radius-pill: 9999px;
        --radius-md: 20px;
        --radius-lg: 28px;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      body {
        font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
        background-color: var(--bg-dark);
        background-image:
          radial-gradient(
            circle at 10% 20%,
            rgba(41, 182, 246, 0.08),
            transparent 30%
          ),
          radial-gradient(
            circle at 90% 80%,
            rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.06),
            transparent 35%
          ),
          linear-gradient(180deg, #131728 0%, #0d101c 100%);
        background-attachment: fixed;
        color: var(--text-main);
        min-height: 100vh;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3,
      h4,
      .brand-title {
        font-family: "Outfit", "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      button,
      input,
      select,
      textarea {
        font-family: inherit;
        outline: none;
        border: none;
      }

      /* Scrollbar */
      ::-webkit-scrollbar {
        width: 7px;
        height: 7px;
      }
      ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
        background: var(--bg-dark);
      }
      ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
        background: var(--card-sub);
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
        background: var(--gold);
      }

      /* App Structure */
      .app-shell {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      /* Sidebar */
      .sidebar {
        background: var(--bg-sidebar);
        border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 24px 16px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        height: 100vh;
        overflow-y: auto;
        z-index: 25;
      }

      .brand-box {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        padding-bottom: 18px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .brand-emblem {
        width: 95px;
        height: 95px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, #29b6f6 0%, #1565c0 100%);
        border: 3px solid var(--gold);
        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(41, 182, 246, 0.4);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .brand-title {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .brand-sub {
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--gold);
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        margin-top: 2px;
      }

      /* Nav Links */
      .nav-list {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        flex: 1;
      }

      .nav-link {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        background: transparent;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .nav-link i {
        width: 19px;
        height: 19px;
        stroke-width: 2.2px;
      }

      .nav-link:hover {
        color: #ffffff;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        transform: translateX(3px);
      }

      .nav-link.active {
        color: #ffffff;
        background: rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.14);
        border-color: var(--border-gold);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      }

      .nav-link.active i {
        color: var(--gold);
      }

      .sidebar-footer {
        margin-top: auto;
        padding-top: 16px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .role-info-card {
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.1),
          rgba(41, 182, 246, 0.08)
        );
        border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 12px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .role-info-card small {
        display: block;
        color: var(--gold);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }

      .role-info-card p {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin-top: 3px;
      }

      /* Main Area */
      .main-wrap {
        padding: 24px 30px 60px;
        max-width: 1400px;
        width: 100%;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      /* Top Bar Header */
      .topbar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        background: rgba(24, 29, 51, 0.9);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        padding: 16px 22px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .topbar-left h1 {
        font-size: 1.55rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .topbar-left p {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-weight: 500;
        margin-top: 2px;
      }

      .topbar-right {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .profile-card {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
        padding: 6px 14px 6px 8px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }

      .profile-card:hover {
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--gold-glow);
      }

      .profile-avatar {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), #ff9800);
        color: #121524;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }

      .profile-text {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: left;
      }

      .profile-name {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #ffffff;
        max-width: 180px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
      }

      .profile-role {
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--gold);
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      /* Buttons */
      .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      }

      .btn-gold {
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          var(--gold) 0%,
          var(--gold-soft) 100%
        );
        color: #121524;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .btn-outline {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        color: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .btn-outline:hover {
        border-color: var(--gold);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      }

      .btn-pill-action {
        background: var(--gold);
        color: #121524;
        padding: 6px 16px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 0.76rem;
      }

      .btn-danger {
        background: rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.15);
        color: #ff7676;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.3);
      }

      /* Page Visibility */
      .page-view {
        display: none;
        animation: pageFadeIn 0.22s ease-in-out;
      }

      .page-view.active {
        display: block;
      }

      @keyframes pageFadeIn {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(5px);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
      }

      /* Generic Panel */
      .panel-card {
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      }

      .panel-head {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .panel-heading {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #ffffff;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      /* ========================================================
       PAGE: BERANDA (Dashboard)
       ======================================================== */
      .stats-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }

      .stat-card {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #222946 0%, #181d33 100%);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        padding: 16px 18px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        transition:
          transform 0.2s,
          border-color 0.2s;
      }

      .stat-card:hover {
        border-color: var(--border-gold);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .stat-icon {
        width: 46px;
        height: 46px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.12);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.25);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: var(--gold);
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .stat-val {
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        color: #ffffff;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      .stat-lbl {
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 2px;
      }

      .map-box {
        height: 360px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        position: relative;
      }

      #mapHome {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: #0f1626;
      }

      /* Akses Cepat */
      .quick-box {
        margin-top: 20px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1d233d 0%, #161b2e 100%);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .quick-box h3 {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #ffffff;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .quick-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .quick-btn-card {
        background: #242c4a;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        padding: 18px 12px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        gap: 10px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
      }

      .quick-btn-card:hover {
        background: #2c365c;
        border-color: var(--gold);
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      }

      .quick-btn-icon {
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.12);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.3);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: var(--gold);
      }

      .quick-btn-card span {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text-main);
      }

      /* ========================================================
       PAGE: INFORMASI (Kenapa BTS Dibentuk?)
       ======================================================== */
      .info-header {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 780px;
        margin: 0 auto 28px;
      }

      .info-header h2 {
        font-size: 1.7rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        color: #ffffff;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .info-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .info-card {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #232b49 0%, #171d33 100%);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 22px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
        transition:
          border-color 0.2s,
          transform 0.2s;
      }

      .info-card:hover {
        border-color: var(--gold);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .info-tag {
        align-self: flex-start;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .info-tag.t1 {
        background: rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.15);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.4);
        color: var(--gold);
      }
      .info-tag.t2 {
        background: rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.15);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.4);
        color: #ff7676;
      }
      .info-tag.t3 {
        background: rgba(78, 204, 163, 0.15);
        border: 1px solid rgba(78, 204, 163, 0.4);
        color: var(--teal);
      }
      .info-tag.t4 {
        background: rgba(41, 182, 246, 0.15);
        border: 1px solid rgba(41, 182, 246, 0.4);
        color: var(--cyan);
      }

      .info-card p {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-size: 0.86rem;
      }

      /* ========================================================
       PAGE: LOKASI PENDARATAN PENYU
       ======================================================== */
      .filter-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .pill-input,
      .pill-select {
        background: var(--input-bg);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 10px 16px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        min-width: 140px;
      }

      .pill-input::placeholder {
        color: var(--input-placeholder);
      }

      .pill-select option {
        background: #1c223c;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .charts-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
        gap: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }

      .chart-box {
        background: #1b213b;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        padding: 16px;
        height: 270px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .chart-box h4 {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--gold);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }

      .chart-inner {
        flex: 1;
        position: relative;
        min-height: 0;
      }

      /* Data Table */
      .table-responsive {
        overflow-x: auto;
        background: #171d33;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      }

      .bts-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }

      .bts-table th {
        background: #13182b;
        color: var(--gold);
        padding: 13px 16px;
        font-weight: 800;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .bts-table td {
        padding: 13px 16px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        color: var(--text-main);
        vertical-align: middle;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .bts-table tr:hover td {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
      }

      .badge-pill {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 4px 10px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .badge-sisik {
        background: rgba(41, 182, 246, 0.15);
        color: var(--cyan);
        border: 1px solid rgba(41, 182, 246, 0.3);
      }

      .badge-hijau {
        background: rgba(78, 204, 163, 0.15);
        color: var(--teal);
        border: 1px solid rgba(78, 204, 163, 0.3);
      }

      .status-adopsi {
        display: inline-flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2px;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 800;
      }
      .status-adopsi.sudah {
        color: var(--teal);
      }
      .status-adopsi.belum {
        color: var(--text-muted);
      }
      .status-adopsi small {
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .row-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 6px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      /* ========================================================
       PAGE: PROGRAM ADOPSI
       ======================================================== */
      .adopsi-tabs {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }

      .tab-btn {
        padding: 10px 22px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        cursor: pointer;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: #1b213c;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }

      .tab-btn.active {
        background: var(--gold);
        color: #121524;
        border-color: var(--gold);
      }

      .adopt-cards-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .turtle-card {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #252d4e 0%, #191f37 100%);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        overflow: hidden;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        transition:
          transform 0.2s,
          border-color 0.2s;
      }

      .turtle-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        border-color: var(--border-gold);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      }

      .turtle-img-wrap {
        height: 190px;
        background: #14192d;
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .turtle-img-wrap img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      .turtle-badge-species {
        position: absolute;
        top: 12px;
        right: 12px;
        background: rgba(18, 21, 36, 0.88);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        color: var(--gold);
        padding: 5px 12px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
      }

      .turtle-content {
        padding: 20px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        flex: 1;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .turtle-content h3 {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .turtle-price {
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
      }

      .turtle-price strong {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        color: var(--gold);
        font-weight: 900;
      }

      .turtle-content p {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      /* Progress bar */
      .prog-track {
        width: 100%;
        height: 10px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        background: #121626;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      }

      .prog-fill {
        height: 100%;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        background: linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          #ff5252 0%,
          var(--gold) 50%,
          var(--teal) 100%
        );
      }

      /* ========================================================
       PAGE: PROGRAM KOLABORASI
       ======================================================== */
      .partner-list-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 14px;
      }

      .partner-circle {
        width: 105px;
        height: 105px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 3px solid var(--gold);
        box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 10px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #121524;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
      }

      .partner-circle:hover {
        transform: scale(1.08);
        border-color: var(--cyan);
      }

      /* ========================================================
       PAGE: WISATA BAHARI
       ======================================================== */
      .tour-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .tour-card {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #242c4c 0%, #1a2037 100%);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 22px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        min-height: 340px;
        transition:
          transform 0.2s,
          border-color 0.2s;
      }

      .tour-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        border-color: var(--gold);
      }

      .tour-top {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .tour-tag {
        align-self: flex-start;
        background: rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.15);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
        color: var(--gold);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        padding: 4px 12px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      }

      .tour-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .tour-card p {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      /* ========================================================
       PAGE: INVESTASI
       ======================================================== */
      .invest-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .invest-card {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #232b4b 0%, #191f37 100%);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 22px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .invest-card:hover {
        border-color: var(--gold);
      }

      .invest-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      /* ========================================================
       MODAL STYLES (MATCHING DESIGN)
       ======================================================== */
      .modal-overlay {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(8, 11, 22, 0.84);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        z-index: 100;
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 20px;
        animation: modalPop 0.2s ease-out;
      }

      .modal-overlay.open {
        display: flex;
      }

      @keyframes modalPop {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: scale(0.96);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: scale(1);
        }
      }

      .modal-box {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 520px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1c223c 0%, #15192c 100%);
        border: 2px solid var(--border-gold);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 28px 26px;
        box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
        position: relative;
        max-height: 90vh;
        overflow-y: auto;
      }

      .modal-box.wide {
        max-width: 650px;
      }

      .modal-head {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        position: relative;
      }

      .modal-head h2 {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        color: var(--gold);
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding-bottom: 10px;
        display: inline-block;
        position: relative;
      }

      .modal-head h2::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 15%;
        right: 15%;
        height: 2px;
        background: var(--gold);
        border-radius: 2px;
      }

      .btn-back-modal {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--gold);
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }

      .btn-back-modal:hover {
        background: var(--gold);
        color: #121524;
      }

      .btn-close-modal {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        right: 0;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: #ffffff;
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      /* Modal Form Pill Inputs */
      .form-row {
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        text-align: left;
      }

      .form-row label {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #ffffff;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .form-row label small {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .pill-form-input {
        width: 100%;
        background: var(--input-bg);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        padding: 13px 20px;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        box-shadow: inset 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }

      .pill-form-input::placeholder {
        color: var(--input-placeholder);
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .pill-form-input:focus {
        background: #7d96b0;
        border-color: var(--gold);
      }

      select.pill-form-input option {
        background: #1c223c;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .btn-submit-modal {
        width: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold) 0%, #ffbe1a 100%);
        color: #121524;
        padding: 13px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        cursor: pointer;
        margin-top: 14px;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px var(--gold-glow);
      }

      .btn-submit-modal:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(255, 206, 49, 0.4);
      }

      /* Category Buttons in Modal */
      .role-grid-buttons {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .role-grid-btn {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 13px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        background: var(--input-bg);
        color: #ffffff;
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        text-align: center;
        cursor: pointer;
        border: 2px solid transparent;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }

      .role-grid-btn.active {
        background: #9ab3cb;
        border-color: var(--gold);
        color: #121524;
      }

      /* Stepper in Tahapan Modal */
      .stepper-box {
        background: #252e4f;
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        padding: 16px 12px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }

      .stepper-items {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        position: relative;
      }

      .stepper-items::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: 18px;
        left: 10%;
        right: 10%;
        height: 3px;
        background: #394572;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .step-node {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        gap: 5px;
        width: 75px;
      }

      .step-icon-circle {
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #171d33;
        border: 2px solid #58699b;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
      }

      .step-node.completed .step-icon-circle {
        background: var(--teal);
        border-color: var(--teal);
        color: #121524;
      }

      .step-node.active .step-icon-circle {
        background: var(--gold);
        border-color: var(--gold);
        color: #121524;
      }

      .step-node span {
        font-size: 0.64rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .step-node.active span,
      .step-node.completed span {
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .phase-cards-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .phase-item-card {
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        overflow: hidden;
        color: #121524;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      }

      .phase-item-card .phase-head {
        background: #f0f4f9;
        padding: 8px;
        font-weight: 900;
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        color: #121524;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .phase-item-card .phase-img {
        height: 100px;
        background: #e2e8f0;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .phase-item-card .phase-img img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      .phase-item-card .phase-body {
        padding: 8px 10px;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
        color: #334155;
        flex: 1;
      }

      /* Toast Notification */
      .toast-alert {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 24px;
        right: 24px;
        background: #1c233e;
        border: 2px solid var(--gold);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 14px 22px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        z-index: 999;
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        animation: toastSlide 0.3s ease;
      }

      .toast-alert.show {
        display: flex;
      }

      @keyframes toastSlide {
        from {
          transform: translateX(100%);
          opacity: 0;
        }
        to {
          transform: translateX(0);
          opacity: 1;
        }
      }

      /* Responsive */
      @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .app-shell {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .sidebar {
          position: relative;
          height: auto;
        }
        .stats-row {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }
        .charts-row,
        .adopt-cards-grid,
        .info-grid,
        .tour-grid,
        .invest-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .quick-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .main-wrap {
          padding: 16px;
        }
        .stats-row,
        .quick-grid,
        .phase-cards-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="app-shell">
      <!-- SIDEBAR NAVIGATION -->
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="brand-box">
          <div class="brand-emblem">
            <!-- Turtle Logo Emblem SVG -->
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 100 100"
              fill="none"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            >
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="48" fill="#1565C0" />
              <path
                d="M50 18C33 18 20 31 20 48C20 62 29 74 42 77C44 77.5 46 76 46 74V68C46 64 49 61 53 61C57 61 60 64 60 68V74C60 76 62 77.5 64 77C77 74 86 62 86 48C86 31 73 18 50 18Z"
                fill="#29B6F6"
              />
              <ellipse
                cx="50"
                cy="46"
                rx="22"
                ry="18"
                fill="#4ECCA3"
                stroke="#004D40"
                stroke-width="2.5"
              />
              <path
                d="M40 38L50 44L60 38M40 54L50 48L60 54M50 30V44M50 48V62"
                stroke="#004D40"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <circle
                cx="50"
                cy="22"
                r="10"
                fill="#4ECCA3"
                stroke="#004D40"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <circle cx="46" cy="20" r="2.5" fill="#121524" />
              <circle cx="54" cy="20" r="2.5" fill="#121524" />
              <rect
                x="10"
                y="70"
                width="80"
                height="18"
                rx="9"
                fill="#FFCE31"
                stroke="#FFFFFF"
                stroke-width="1.5"
              />
              <text
                x="50"
                y="83"
                font-family="'Outfit', sans-serif"
                font-size="9"
                font-weight="900"
                fill="#121524"
                text-anchor="middle"
              >
                BTS SQUAD
              </text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="brand-title">BLUE TURTLE SQUAD</h2>
          <span class="brand-sub">LOKA PENGELOLAAN ANAMBAS</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Navigation Menu Items -->
        <ul class="nav-list">
          <li>
            <a class="nav-link active" data-page="page-beranda">
              <i data-lucide="home"></i>
              <span>Beranda</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="nav-link" data-page="page-informasi">
              <i data-lucide="file-text"></i>
              <span>Informasi</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="nav-link" data-page="page-lokasi">
              <i data-lucide="map-pin"></i>
              <span>Lokasi Pendaratan Penyu</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="nav-link" data-page="page-adopsi">
              <i data-lucide="shield-check"></i>
              <span>Program Adopsi</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="nav-link" data-page="page-kolaborasi">
              <i data-lucide="users"></i>
              <span>Program Kolaborasi</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="nav-link" data-page="page-wisata">
              <i data-lucide="compass"></i>
              <span>Program Wisata Bahari</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="nav-link" data-page="page-investasi">
              <i data-lucide="trending-up"></i>
              <span>Program Investasi</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="nav-link" data-page="page-laporan">
              <i data-lucide="clipboard-list"></i>
              <span>Laporan</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li id="menuKelola" style="display: none">
            <a class="nav-link" data-page="page-pengguna">
              <i data-lucide="user-cog"></i>
              <span>Kelola Pengguna</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="sidebar-footer">
          <div class="role-info-card">
            <small id="sideRoleTag">SUPER ADMIN</small>
            <p id="sideRoleDesc">Akses penuh ke semua data & formulir.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <!-- MAIN WRAPPER -->
      <main class="main-wrap">
        <!-- TOP BAR HEADER -->
        <header class="topbar">
          <div class="topbar-left">
            <h1>BLUE TURTLE SQUAD</h1>
            <p>Kolaborasi Nyata untuk Lindungi Penyu Anambas</p>
          </div>

          <div class="topbar-right">
            <!-- Profile -->
            <div
              class="profile-card"
              onclick="openProfileMenu()"
              title="Klik nama untuk membuka menu akun"
            >
              <div class="profile-avatar" id="topAvatar">SA</div>
              <div class="profile-text">
                <span class="profile-name" id="topUserName">Super Admin</span>
                <span class="profile-role" id="topUserRole">SUPER ADMIN</span>
              </div>
              <i
                data-lucide="chevron-down"
                style="width: 16px; height: 16px; color: var(--text-muted)"
              ></i>
            </div>
          </div>
        </header>

        <!-- ========================================================
           PAGE 1: BERANDA
           ======================================================== -->
        <section id="page-beranda" class="page-view active">
          <!-- 4 Quick Stats -->
          <div class="stats-row">
            <div class="stat-card">
              <div class="stat-icon"><i data-lucide="egg"></i></div>
              <div>
                <div class="stat-val" id="statTelur">480</div>
                <div class="stat-lbl">Telur Tercatat</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
              <div class="stat-icon"><i data-lucide="map-pin"></i></div>
              <div>
                <div class="stat-val" id="statLokasi">12</div>
                <div class="stat-lbl">Lokasi Penyu Tercatat</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
              <div class="stat-icon"><i data-lucide="user-check"></i></div>
              <div>
                <div class="stat-val" id="statAdopter">86</div>
                <div class="stat-lbl">Banyak Adopter</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
              <div class="stat-icon"><i data-lucide="building-2"></i></div>
              <div>
                <div class="stat-val" id="statMitra">24</div>
                <div class="stat-lbl">Banyak Mitra</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Hero Map Panel -->
          <div class="panel-card">
            <div class="panel-head">
              <div class="panel-heading">
                <i data-lucide="map" class="text-gold"></i>
                <span>Peta Lokasi Kegiatan & Pendaratan Penyu Anambas</span>
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="goToPage('page-lokasi')">
                <span>Lihat Detail Pendaratan</span>
                <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="map-box">
              <div id="mapHome"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Akses Cepat 4 Card Grid -->
          <div class="quick-box">
            <h3>Akses cepat</h3>
            <div class="quick-grid">
              <div class="quick-btn-card" onclick="goToPage('page-adopsi')">
                <div class="quick-btn-icon">
                  <i data-lucide="shield-check"></i>
                </div>
                <span>Program Adopsi</span>
              </div>
              <div class="quick-btn-card" onclick="goToPage('page-kolaborasi')">
                <div class="quick-btn-icon"><i data-lucide="users"></i></div>
                <span>Program Kolaborasi</span>
              </div>
              <div class="quick-btn-card" onclick="goToPage('page-investasi')">
                <div class="quick-btn-icon">
                  <i data-lucide="trending-up"></i>
                </div>
                <span>Program Investasi</span>
              </div>
              <div class="quick-btn-card" onclick="goToPage('page-wisata')">
                <div class="quick-btn-icon"><i data-lucide="compass"></i></div>
                <span>Program Wisata Bahari</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ========================================================
           PAGE 2: INFORMASI
           ======================================================== -->
        <section id="page-informasi" class="page-view">
          <div class="info-header">
            <h2>Kenapa Blue Turtle Squad (BTS) Dibentuk?</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem">
              Kolaborasi Nyata untuk Lindungi Penyu di Kawasan Konservasi
              Kepulauan Anambas
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="info-grid">
            <!-- Card 1 -->
            <div class="info-card">
              <div class="info-tag t1">Kondisi Saat Ini</div>
              <p>
                Kegiatan konservasi penyu di Kawasan Konservasi Kepulauan
                Anambas masih berjalan secara terpisah-pisah. Data belum
                terintegrasi, peran antar pihak belum jelas, dan kolaborasi
                masih bersifat parsial.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="info-card">
              <div class="info-tag t2">Tantangan yang Dihadapi</div>
              <p>
                Pengelolaan belum optimal, partisipasi masyarakat masih rendah,
                serta belum ada sistem yang menyatukan seluruh pihak dalam satu
                wadah.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3 -->
            <div class="info-card">
              <div class="info-tag t3">Solusi yang Dihadirkan</div>
              <p>
                Blue Turtle Squad (BTS) hadir sebagai platform digital yang
                menghubungkan pengelola, masyarakat, dan mitra dalam satu sistem
                kolaborasi.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 4 -->
            <div class="info-card">
              <div class="info-tag t4">Harapan ke Depan</div>
              <p>
                Dengan adanya BTS, diharapkan kolaborasi antar pihak semakin
                kuat, partisipasi masyarakat meningkat, data lebih terintegrasi,
                serta perlindungan penyu di Anambas berjalan lebih efektif dan
                berkelanjutan.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ========================================================
           PAGE 3: LOKASI PENDARATAN PENYU
           ======================================================== -->
        <section id="page-lokasi" class="page-view">
          <div class="panel-card">
            <div class="panel-head">
              <div class="panel-heading">
                <i data-lucide="map-pin" class="text-gold"></i>
                <span>Data Lokasi & Pendaratan Penyu</span>
              </div>
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px">
                <button class="btn btn-outline" id="btnImporSample">
                  <i data-lucide="upload"></i>
                  <span>Impor +</span>
                </button>
                <button
                  class="btn btn-gold"
